laya-v1.tokenizer.json is an unmodified copy of the laya-v1 release asset (SHA-256
5a6d8079dcaeec0d8982ed75c78a73d5cc00e1d2192020e1e454d6952def15f4), used only by
tests/classifier.test.ts to check token ids against ml/laya/golden/laya-v1.golden.json.

It is the vocabulary-pruned tokenizer of the SkimCare fine-tune of Laya:
